description |
  bench/utf8@0.1 -- the UTF-8 encoding set ([B77],
  inbox I-90). Seventy-five patterns in six
  encoding-dependence families plus the floor, BUILT ON
  this format as its pattern source of truth. See
  docs/design/utf8_set_v1.md and bench/utf8/NOTES.md.

oracle pcre2
vocabulary family cls lit ci alt-qnt asr prp floor
vocabulary hazard none
vocabulary requires utf8-encoding ascii-class-scope unicode-class-scope lookaround true-end-anchor unicode-properties
